[constraint-03] The choice between extracting nested content and reporting it as unread
    is made once, stated, and applied uniformly.
    -> obligation-uniform-decision-for-nested-content  [invariant/explicit]
       The nested-content accounting decision is made once and applied consistently
       across the parse.

